<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>DropFlow sample</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; }
.ARSACC { Name: Arabic; lang: ar-SA; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=ENUSCC>Hello <i>world</i><br>second
  line
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=ARSACC>مرحبا بالعالم
<SYNC Start=3500><P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=3500><P Class=ARSACC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start="4000"><P Class=ENUSCC><font color="#ffff00">Fish &amp; chips</font>
<SYNC Start="4000"><P Class=ARSACC>سمك وبطاطا
<SYNC Start=6000><P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=6000><P Class=ARSACC>&nbsp;
</BODY>
</SAMI>
